### Crear reserva vinculada a cliente
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteId": 5,
  "hotelId": 2,
  "tipoHabitacion": "DOBLE",
  "fechaEntrada": "2026-11-02",
  "fechaSalida": "2026-11-12"
}

